OL,3,GNEWSACity centre bar to reopen after
OL,4,Alicence suspension over stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA city centre gay bar will be allowed
OL,7,Fto reopen after three men were stabbed
OL,8,Foutside the venue last month.
OL,10,FGbar on Tithebarn Street in Liverpool
OL,11,Fhad its licence suspended after the
OL,12,Fincident on 20 September, but will now
OL,13,Fwelcome clubbers again.
OL,15,FLiverpool Council's licensing and
OL,16,Fgambling sub-committee will permit the
OL,17,Fvenue to open until 08:00 BST, despite
OL,18,FMerseyside Police recommending a 06:00
OL,19,FBST closure.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
